## 회원가입
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email" : "test@test.com",
  "password": "test1234",
  "nickname":"테스트"
}

### 로그인
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "test1234"
}

### 정보조회
@access_token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzM4NCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIxIiwicm9sZSI6IlJPTEVfVVNFUiIsImlhdCI6MTc5MTUyMDY1MSwiZXhwIjoxNzkxNTIxNTUxfQ.7XfVCc1WHkHG3tFVvo6wS_Fw6PXGJudHQU9EvY_9biD5L6N7jS73u5fEa1ox-JWJ
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/info
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}


### 닉네임 수정
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/users/update/name
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nickname" : "홍길동"
}

### 비밀번호 변경
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/users/update/password
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "test1234",
  "newPassword": "newpassword123"
}

### 회원탈퇴
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/users/info
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}